# # /cardiac-icu-kg/
#
# https://w3id.org/cardiac-icu-kg/ and every IRI below it redirect to the
# archived release of a provenance-layered knowledge graph for cardiac
# surgery and intensive care on Zenodo. The target is the concept record,
# which always resolves to the latest version.
#
# The IRIs name things in the graph (nodes, relations, properties, classes,
# edge records and named graphs), so the redirect is a 303 to a document
# about them.
#
# Code: https://gitlab.com/rnkous/cardiac-icu-kg
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Mihamad Abdulkader
# Mihamad.Abdulkader@med.uni-duesseldorf.de
# GitHub username: rnkous-med

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^ https://zenodo.org/records/23944677 [R=303,L]
